Package: readNBS
Title: Read Official China NBS National Data
Version: 0.8.3
Authors@R:
    person("Chartwell", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "chartwell@example.invalid")
Description: A defensive client for official time series from the
    National Bureau of Statistics of China's National Data portal. It exposes
    stable semantic series and dimensional dataset identifiers backed by
    versioned bilingual manifests, while isolating the portal's undocumented
    UUID-based JSON transport, schema checks, caching, provenance,
    time-slice stitching, a bundled normalized first-release archive,
    irregular reference windows, and explicit opt-in regularisation of
    reported cumulative flows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readNBS
BugReports: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readNBS/issues
